// Great powers of the HRE map. GreatPowers.TopKingdoms lists the top 9
// of the fame ranking whose fame reaches Fame.max (10000) * min_fame_perc / 100; the percentage
// fades from this value to 0 over min_fame_perc_fade_time minutes. Vanilla's 25 (2500 fame) left
// only Germany in the list on this fragmented map: at the start the 9th kingdom has ~700-1150 fame,
// and 5 % would not drop anyone either (fame report, plugin F7).

FameRanking
{
	min_fame_perc = 0
}
